+## Version 8.5.1
+
+Unreleased
+
+- Defaults configured through `default_map` are applied to subcommands again.
+  A subcommand's context looks up its own name in the parent's `default_map`
+  instead of reusing the parent's whole map.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
